  25:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****     [..]          
  26:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****       (+) When Dual mode is enabled (i.e. DAC Channel1 and Channel2 are used simultaneously) :
  27:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           Use HAL_DACEx_DualGetValue() to get digital data to be converted and use
  28:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****           HAL_DACEx_DualSetValue() to set digital value to converted simultaneously in Channel 1 an
  29:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DACEx_TriangleWaveGenerate() to generate Triangle signal.
  30:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DACEx_NoiseWaveGenerate() to generate Noise signal.
