 100:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @brief  Set the specified data holding register value for DAC channel.
 101:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @param  hdac pointer to a DAC_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
 102:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *         the configuration information for the specified DAC.
 103:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @param  Channel The selected DAC channel. 
 104:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @param  Alignment Specifies the data alignment for DAC channel.
 105:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 106:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *            @arg DAC_ALIGN_8B_R: 8bit right data alignment selected
 107:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *            @arg DAC_ALIGN_12B_L: 12bit left data alignment selected
 108:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *            @arg DAC_ALIGN_12B_R: 12bit right data alignment selected
