 155:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c **** /**
 156:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @brief  Set the specified data holding register value for dual DAC channel.
 157:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @param  hdac pointer to a DAC_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
 158:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *         the configuration information for the specified DAC.
 159:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @param  Alignment Specifies the data alignment for dual channel DAC.
 160:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 161:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *            @arg DAC_ALIGN_8B_R: 8bit right data alignment selected
 162:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *            @arg DAC_ALIGN_12B_L: 12bit left data alignment selected
 163:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *            @arg DAC_ALIGN_12B_R: 12bit right data alignment selected
 164:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @param  Data2: Data for DAC Channel2 to be loaded in the selected data holding register.
 165:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @param  Data1: Data for DAC Channel1 to be loaded in the selected data  holding register.
 166:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @note   In dual mode, a unique register access is required to write in both
 167:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   *          DAC channels at the same time.
 168:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac_ex.c ****   * @retval HAL status
